\af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid3239478\charrsid8993412 Thi h\'e0nh Quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh s\u7889\'3f 398/TTg ng\'e0y 04/08/1994 c\u7911\'3fa Th\u7911\'3f t\'fd\u7899\'3fng Ch\'ednh ph\u7911\'3f v\u7873\'3f b\u7893\'3f sung m\u7897
\'3ft s\u7889\'3f bi\u7879\'3fn ph\'e1p \'f0i\u7873\'3fu h\'e0nh Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc n\'e3m 1994; B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh h\'fd\u7899\'3fng d\u7851\'3fn c\u7909\'3f th\u7875\'3f m\u7897\'3ft s\u7889\'3f \'f0i\u7875\'3fm nh\'fd
 sau :
\par 1/ Tr\'ean c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f ch\u7881\'3f ti\'eau ph\u7845\'3fn \'f0\u7845\'3fu t\'e3ng thu Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch n\'e3m 1994 \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc B\u7897\'3f tr\'fd\u7903\'3fng B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh giao cho t\u7915\'3fng t\u7881\'3fnh, th\'e0nh ph\u7889
\'3f v\'e0 T\u7893\'3fng c\u7909\'3fc H\u7843\'3fi quan theo u\u7927\'3f quy\u7873\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa Th\u7911\'3f t\'fd\u7899\'3fng Ch\'ednh ph\u7911\'3f; Ch\u7911\'3f t\u7883\'3fch U\u7927\'3f ban nh\'e2n d\'e2n c\'e1c t\u7881\'3fnh, th\'e0nh ph\u7889
\'3f tr\u7921\'3fc thu\u7897\'3fc Trung \'fd\'f5ng v\'e0 T\u7893\'3fng c\u7909\'3fc tr\'fd\u7903\'3fng T\u7893\'3fng c\u7909\'3fc H\u7843\'3fi quan c\u7847\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid11016573 n}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 
\ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid3239478\charrsid8993412 :
\par a/ Ch\u7881\'3f \'f0\u7841\'3fo c\'e1c c\u7845\'3fp, c\'e1c ng\'e0nh v\'e0 c\'e1c c\'f5 quan ch\u7913\'3fc n\'e3ng r\'e0 so\'e1t, \'f0\'e1nh gi\'e1 s\'e1t k\u7871\'3ft qu\u7843\'3f th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn thu Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch nh\u7919\'3fng th\'e1ng 
\'f0\u7847\'3fu n\'e3m, d\u7921\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid3239478\charrsid8993412  t\'ednh t\'ecnh h\'ecnh s}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid3239478\charrsid8993412 \u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3f
t kinh doanh v\'e0 bi\u7871\'3fn \'f0\u7897\'3fng v\u7873\'3f th\u7883\'3f tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng, gi\'e1 c\u7843\'3f nh\u7919\'3fng th\'e1ng cu\u7889\'3fi n\'e3m 1994 \u7903\'3f t\u7915\'3fng l\u297\'3fnh v\u7921\'3fc, t\u7915\'3fng ng\'e0nh v\'e0 nh\u7919
\'3fng \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f tr\u7885\'3fng \'f0i\u7875\'3fm \'f0\u7875\'3f c\'f3 c\'e3n c\u7913\'3f giao m\u7913\'3fc ph\u7845\'3fn \'f0\u7845\'3fu thu n\u7897\'3fp Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch n\'e3m 1994 cho ph\'f9 h\u7907\'3fp v\u7899\'3fi t\u7915\'3fng ng\'e0
nh, t\u7915\'3fng c\u7845\'3fp v\'e0 c\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f \'f0\u7843\'3fm b\u7843\'3fo }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid3239478\charrsid9390944 s\u7889\'3f t\'e3ng thu Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch t\u7889\'3fi thi
\u7875\'3fu}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid3239478\charrsid8993412  nh\'fd ch\u7881\'3f ti\'eau ph\u7845\'3fn \'f0\u7845\'3fu Trung \'fd\'f5ng th\'f4ng b\'e1o.
\par b/ Th\'fd\u7901\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid3239478\charrsid8993412 ng xuy\'ean theo d\'f5i t\'ecnh h\'ecnh v\'e0 }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid3239478\charrsid8993412 \'f0\'e1nh gi\'e1 k
\u7871\'3ft qu\u7843\'3f thu h\'e0ng th\'e1ng, qu\'ed \'f0\u7875\'3f k\u7883\'3fp th\u7901\'3fi \'f0\u7873\'3f ra c\'e1c bi\u7879\'3fn ph\'e1p c\u7909\'3f th\u7875\'3f, nh\u7857\'3fm th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn \'f0\u7841\'3ft v\'e0 v\'fd\u7907\'3ft ch
\u7881\'3f ti\'eau ph\u7845\'3fn \'f0\u7845\'3fu thu Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch \'f0}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid3239478\charrsid8993412 \'e3 }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid3239478\charrsid8993412 \'f0
\'fd\u7907\'3fc giao.
\par c/ Cu\u7889\'3fi n\'e3m c\u7847\'3fn c\'f3 t\u7893\'3fng k\u7871\'3ft, \'f0\'e1nh gi\'e1 k\u7871\'3ft qu\u7843\'3f c\'f4ng t\'e1c n\'e0y \'f0\u7875\'3f b\'e1o c\'e1o Th\u7911\'3f t\'fd\u7899\'3fng Ch\'ednh ph\u7911\'3f, \'f0\u7891\'3fng th\u7901\'3fi r
\'fat kinh nghi\u7879\'3fm cho vi\u7879\'3fc t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc ch\u7881\'3f \'f0\u7841\'3fo c\'f4ng t\'e1c thu n\'e3m 1995.
\par 2/ V\u7873\'3f vi\u7879\'3fc thu n\u7897\'3fp v\'e0 \'f0i\u7873\'3fu ti\u7871\'3ft gi\u7919\'3fa c\u7845\'3fp Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi c\'e1c kho\u7843\'3fn thu v\u7873\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn b\'e1n nh\'e0 v\'e0 \'f0\u7845\'3ft :
\par a/ M\u7885\'3fi kho\u7843\'3fn thu v\u7873\'3f c\u7845\'3fp quy\u7873\'3fn s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng \'f0\u7845\'3ft, thu v\u7873\'3f thu\u7871\'3f chuy\u7875\'3fn quy\u7873\'3fn s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng \'f0\u7845\'3ft, thu v\u7873\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn b
\'e1n nh\'e0 \u7903\'3f thu\u7897\'3fc s\u7903\'3f h\u7919\'3fu Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc ph\'e1t sinh trong c\u7843\'3f n\'e3m 1994 \'f0\u7873\'3fu ph\u7843\'3fi n\u7897\'3fp \'f0\u7847\'3fy \'f0\u7911\'3f v\'e0o Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3f
c (Thu v\u7873\'3f c\u7845\'3fp quy\u7873\'3fn s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng \'f0\u7845\'3ft h\u7841\'3fch to\'e1n v\'e0o m\u7909\'3fc 28, thu v\u7873\'3f  thu\u7871\'3f chuy\u7875\'3fn quy\u7873\'3fn s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng \'f0\u7845\'3ft h\u7841\'3fch to
\'e1n v\'e0o m\u7909\'3fc 29, thu v\u7873\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn b\'e1n nh\'e0 \u7903\'3f thu\u7897\'3fc s\u7903\'3f h\u7919\'3fu Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc h\u7841\'3fch to\'e1n v\'e0o m\u7909\'3fc 40).
\par b/  Vi\u7879\'3fc \'f0i\u7873\'3fu ti\u7871\'3ft gi\u7919\'3fa Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch Trung \'fd\'f5ng v\'e0 Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch \'f0\u7883\'3fa ph\'fd\'f5ng v\u7873\'3f c\'e1c kho\u7843\'3fn thu n\'eau tr\'ean trong c\u7843\'3f n\'e3m 1994 \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc x
\u7917\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid3239478\charrsid8993412  l\'fd nh}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid3239478\charrsid8993412 \'fd sau :
\par - S\u7889\'3f thu v\u7873\'3f  thu\u7871\'3f chuy\u7875\'3fn quy\u7873\'3fn s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng \'f0\u7845\'3ft ph\'e1t sinh theo quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh c\u7911\'3fa Lu\u7853\'3ft thu\u7871\'3f chuy\u7875\'3fn quy\u7873\'3fn s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng 
\'f0\u7845\'3ft \'f0}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid3239478\charrsid8993412 \'e3 }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid3239478\charrsid8993412 \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc Qu\u7889\'3fc h\u7897\'3fi kho\'e1 IX k
\u7923\'3f h\u7885\'3fp th\u7913\'3f n\'e3m (th\'e1ng 6 n\'e3m 1994) th\'f4ng qua \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc n\u7897\'3fp 100% v\'e0o Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch Trung \'fd\'f5ng.
\par - S\u7889\'3f thu v\u7873\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn b\'e1n nh\'e0 \u7903\'3f thu\u7897\'3fc s\u7903\'3f h\u7919\'3fu Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc, n\u7897\'3fp 100% v\'e0o Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch Trung \'fd\'f5ng.
\par S\u7889\'3f thu v\u7873\'3f c\u7845\'3fp quy\u7873\'3fn s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng \'f0\u7845\'3ft : \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc \'f0i\u7873\'3fu ti\u7871\'3ft v\'e0o Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch Trung \'fd\'f5ng 50% \'f0\u7875\'3f b\'f9 \'f0\u7855\'3fp c\'e1c kho\u7843\'3f
n vay kh\'f4ng th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc theo k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch v\'e0 Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch \'f0\u7883\'3fa ph\'fd\'f5ng 50% \'f0\u7875\'3f x\'e2y d\u7921\'3fng k\u7871\'3ft c\u7845\'3fu h\u7841\'3f t\u7847\'3fng kinh t\u7871\'3f}
